OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister urges Burnham to be
OL,4,Aserious about Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has been
OL,7,Furged to show he is serious about
OL,8,FWales' needs as he prepares to meet
OL,9,Fwith the Welsh and Scottish first
OL,10,Fministers.
OL,12,FThe former Greater Manchester mayor is
OL,13,Fjoining Plaid Cymru leader Rhun ap
OL,14,FIorwerth and SNP leader John Swinney in
OL,15,FGlasgow on Friday.
OL,17,FBefore the meeting, ap Iorwerth said he
OL,18,Fassumed Burnham was holding something
OL,19,Fback after a UK government Budget that
OL,20,Fhad "little mention" of Wales.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
