OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister urges Burnham to be
OL,4,Aserious about Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham said he would be making an
OL,7,Foffer to each of the devolved
OL,8,Fgovernments at Friday's meeting.
